From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flax <hmccanne@exclamationpoint.com>
Subject: [PATCH] allowlist: add DCMI group extension commands

The intel-ipmi-oem allowlist filter enforces the allowlist unconditionally
on non-system-interface channels (i.e. the LAN channel), independent of the
RestrictionMode setting. The DCMI group extension commands (NetFn 0x2C,
group 0xDC) were never present in ipmi-allowlist.conf, so any DCMI request
over lanplus was rejected with completion code 0xD4 (insufficient privilege):

    ipmitool ... -I lanplus dcmi discover
    DCMI request failed because: Insufficient privilege level (d4)

Add the full DCMI command set that phosphor-ipmi-host registers so DCMI works
over LAN out of the box. Get/discover commands allow all channels (0xff7f);
Set commands exclude the system interface (0x7f7f), matching the convention
used by the other write commands in this file.
---
 ipmi-allowlist.conf | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

--- a/ipmi-allowlist.conf
+++ b/ipmi-allowlist.conf
@@ -160,6 +160,21 @@
 0x2c:0x30:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<Set TPM Configuration>
 0x2c:0x31:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<TPM Configuration Update Complete>
 0x2c:0x37:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<Read PCIe Cable EEPROM Data>
+0x2c:0x01:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get DCMI Capabilities>
+0x2c:0x02:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Power Reading>
+0x2c:0x03:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Power Limit>
+0x2c:0x04:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Set Power Limit>
+0x2c:0x05:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Activate/Deactivate Power Limit>
+0x2c:0x06:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Asset Tag>
+0x2c:0x07:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get DCMI Sensor Info>
+0x2c:0x08:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Set Asset Tag>
+0x2c:0x09:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Mgmt Controller ID String>
+0x2c:0x0a:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Set Mgmt Controller ID String>
+0x2c:0x0b:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Set Thermal Limit>
+0x2c:0x0c:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Thermal Limit>
+0x2c:0x10:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get Temperature Readings>
+0x2c:0x11:0xff7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Get DCMI Config Params>
+0x2c:0x12:0x7f7f   //<Group Extension>:<DCMI Set DCMI Config Params>
 0x2e:0x80:0x8080   //<OpenBMC OEM>:<IPMI Blob Transfer - allow BIOS SMBIOS push via KCS/SMM>
 0x2e:0xC0:0x7f7f   //<Intel OEM>:<Enable/Disable Node Manager Policy Control>
 0x2e:0xC1:0x7f7f   //<Intel OEM>:<Set Node Manager Policy>
